		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-65bee6c6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent" data-id="65bee6c6" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
					<div class="e-con-inner">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-1a3330dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="1a3330dd" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7C3AED;margin:0"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,#FF2E7E,#7C3AED);border-radius:2px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle"></span>Why niche wins</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-557996ff elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="557996ff" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The one beauty niche <span class="hl">that isn't a beauty booking business at all</span></h2>				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2232d41a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="2232d41a" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-a4c7f8b e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="a4c7f8b" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-52a4d557 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="52a4d557" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>Every other page in our industries list is about getting someone to book a treatment. This one isn&#8217;t. A beauty academy&#8217;s entire funnel is an enrollment decision — closer to how a university or vocational college markets itself than how a salon does, and treating it like a booking business badly undersells a genuinely different sales process.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-55dfd694 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="55dfd694" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Accreditation is the single biggest trust signal in this niche</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-22471e2f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="22471e2f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>KHDA, DHA and CIBTAC accreditation aren&#8217;t small print — they&#8217;re often the first thing a prospective student checks, since they determine whether the certification is internationally recognized and career-viable. Academies that lead with this build far more trust than those that bury it in a footer.</p>								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-71e38230 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="71e38230" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">The decision timeline is weeks, not days — and content needs to match</h3>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-122d3e3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="122d3e3e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>A prospective student typically compares courses and fees, verifies career outcomes, and often visits campus before enrolling — a process that can span two to eight weeks. Nurture content (email, retargeting, alumni proof) across that window matters more here than in almost any other beauty-adjacent niche.</p>								</div>
				</div>
		<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-512ebb4e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="512ebb4e" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2376d1b5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="2376d1b5" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:#fff;margin:0 0 14px">Beauty academies, at a glance</p><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">Enrollment funnel</b><span>— not a booking funnel, and needs different content</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">3 bodies</b><span>— KHDA, DHA, CIBTAC accreditation checked first</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">2-8 weeks</b><span>— typical enrollment decision window</span></div><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);font-size:14px;color:#D9D5E4"><b style="font-family:Space Grotesk,sans-serif;color:#C6F432;min-width:130px">International students</b><span>— a real, underserved segment</span></div>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
